{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type QueriesResults<T, TResults, TDepth> = TDepth[\"length\"] extends MAXIMUM_DEPTH ? UseQueryResult[] : T extends [] ? [] : T extends [infer Head] ? [...TResults, GetUseQueryResult<Head>] : T extends [infer Head, ...(infer Tails)] ? QueriesResults<[...Tails], [...TResults, GetUseQueryResult<Head>], [...TDepth, 1]> : { [K in keyof T]: GetUseQueryResult<T[K]> };","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/preact-query/src/useQueries.ts#L209","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/preact-query/src/useQueries.ts:209"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The result type returned by "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useQueries"},{"type":"text","value":", when no "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"combine"},{"type":"text","value":" is provided. Mirrors "},{"type":"link","href":"QueriesOptions.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"QueriesOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":": each\ntuple element's result type is inferred individually, up to 20 elements. A non-tuple array is mapped\nper-element instead, still inferring each entry individually; only past 20 elements does this fall back to a\nsingle homogeneous "},{"type":"link","href":"UseQueryResult.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"UseQueryResult"}]},{"type":"text","value":" type."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"type-parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Type Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"t","children":[{"type":"text","value":"T"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"T"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"any"},{"type":"text","value":"[]"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The type of the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"queries"},{"type":"text","value":" array, as inferred by "},{"type":"link","href":"QueriesOptions.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"QueriesOptions"}]},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tresults","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TResults"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TResults"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"any"},{"type":"text","value":"[] = []"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The internal accumulator that this type builds during recursion. It is not meant\nto be set explicitly."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"tdepth","children":[{"type":"text","value":"TDepth"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TDepth"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"emphasis","children":[{"type":"text","value":"extends"}]},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"ReadonlyArray"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"number"},{"type":"text","value":"> = []"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The internal recursion-depth counter, checked against the 20-element limit. It is not\nmeant to be set explicitly."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"t","text":"T","level":3},{"id":"tresults","text":"TResults","level":3},{"id":"tdepth","text":"TDepth","level":3}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype QueriesResults<T, TResults, TDepth> = TDepth[\"length\"] extends MAXIMUM_DEPTH ? UseQueryResult[] : T extends [] ? [] : T extends [infer Head] ? [...TResults, GetUseQueryResult<Head>] : T extends [infer Head, ...(infer Tails)] ? QueriesResults<[...Tails], [...TResults, GetUseQueryResult<Head>], [...TDepth, 1]> : { [K in keyof T]: GetUseQueryResult<T[K]> };\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/preact-query/src/useQueries.ts:209](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/preact-query/src/useQueries.ts#L209)\n\nThe result type returned by `useQueries`, when no `combine` is provided. Mirrors [QueriesOptions](QueriesOptions.md): each\ntuple element's result type is inferred individually, up to 20 elements. A non-tuple array is mapped\nper-element instead, still inferring each entry individually; only past 20 elements does this fall back to a\nsingle homogeneous [UseQueryResult](UseQueryResult.md) type.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### T\n\n`T` *extends* `any`[]\n\nThe type of the `queries` array, as inferred by [QueriesOptions](QueriesOptions.md).\n\n### TResults\n\n`TResults` *extends* `any`[] = \\[\\]\n\nThe internal accumulator that this type builds during recursion. It is not meant\nto be set explicitly.\n\n### TDepth\n\n`TDepth` *extends* `ReadonlyArray`\\<`number`\\> = \\[\\]\n\nThe internal recursion-depth counter, checked against the 20-element limit. It is not\nmeant to be set explicitly.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: QueriesResults\ntitle: QueriesResults\n---\n\n```ts\ntype QueriesResults<T, TResults, TDepth> = TDepth[\"length\"] extends MAXIMUM_DEPTH ? UseQueryResult[] : T extends [] ? [] : T extends [infer Head] ? [...TResults, GetUseQueryResult<Head>] : T extends [infer Head, ...(infer Tails)] ? QueriesResults<[...Tails], [...TResults, GetUseQueryResult<Head>], [...TDepth, 1]> : { [K in keyof T]: GetUseQueryResult<T[K]> };\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/preact-query/src/useQueries.ts:209](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/preact-query/src/useQueries.ts#L209)\n\nThe result type returned by `useQueries`, when no `combine` is provided. Mirrors [QueriesOptions](QueriesOptions.md): each\ntuple element's result type is inferred individually, up to 20 elements. A non-tuple array is mapped\nper-element instead, still inferring each entry individually; only past 20 elements does this fall back to a\nsingle homogeneous [UseQueryResult](UseQueryResult.md) type.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### T\n\n`T` *extends* `any`[]\n\nThe type of the `queries` array, as inferred by [QueriesOptions](QueriesOptions.md).\n\n### TResults\n\n`TResults` *extends* `any`[] = \\[\\]\n\nThe internal accumulator that this type builds during recursion. It is not meant\nto be set explicitly.\n\n### TDepth\n\n`TDepth` *extends* `ReadonlyArray`\\<`number`\\> = \\[\\]\n\nThe internal recursion-depth counter, checked against the 20-element limit. It is not\nmeant to be set explicitly.\n"}
